00:45:50,000 --> 00:45:56,000
Barbie: Mariposa and Her Butterfly Fairy Friends, also known as Barbie: Mariposa, is a 2008
animated fantasy film directed by Conrad Helten and written by Elise Allen.

12
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
The tagline of the film is "The most beautiful thing you can be is yourself".

13
00:54:10,000 --> 00:54:16,000
The film follows Mariposa (voiced by Chiara Zanni), a butterfly fairy on a Hero's Journey to save Queen
Marabella, and her kingdom, from the evil fairy Henna and the evil flying creatures – Skeezites.

14
00:58:20,000 --> 00:58:26,000
The 12th installment in the Barbie film series, Barbie: Mariposa
is a spin-off of the Barbie: Fairytopia trilogy.

15
01:02:30,000 --> 01:02:36,000
The film has a Spanish influence, with the titular
character's name being Spanish for 'butterfly'.

16
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
It is the first film in the series to not feature Kelly Sheridan's Barbie as the main role,
she instead reprises her role as the character Elina of the Fairytopia trilogy.

17
01:10:50,000 --> 01:10:56,000
The film explores themes of magic, fairy, female
protagonist, butterfly, magic land.
